# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Read from the build output root, so this file has to
# survive Jekyll — leading-underscore names are skipped by default, hence the `include:`
# entry in _config.yml. Verify after any change to it: a silently dropped _redirects is
# indistinguishable from a working one until someone follows an old link.
#
# The legal pages moved from /privacy.html to /privacy/ (a directory permalink, like every
# other page on the site) so the footer links land on a 200 instead of Cloudflare's own
# .html-stripping 308. Pages does NOT keep the old path alive on its own — /about.html,
# which made the same move long ago, answers 404 — so these two rules are what stop an
# existing bookmark to the Datenschutzerklärung from breaking.
/privacy.html    /privacy/      301
/impressum.html  /impressum/    301

# The eleven pre-2026-08-30 Hedgers' Ledger releases were removed on 2026-08-30: the edition
